  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Bonds led the seven choices. All three company shares lost heavily: Cisco lost more than three-quarters, while Microsoft and Amazon lost about half. The US basket also fell, but much less than those individual stocks. A useful technology and a promising business could still be disappointing investments at the price paid.",
